# the push-stream captures the tuxweb tests are built on; no key material,
# no addresses, and without them a clean checkout cannot run its own tests
!tuxweb/tests/fixtures/*.bin

# pubscan's author-specific patterns. Untracked ON PURPOSE: a published
# scanner that carries the literal it hunts for has already disclosed it.
# ci/pubscan.local.example documents the format and IS tracked.
ci/pubscan.local
